    },
    {
      "displayText": "这是一个围绕被请来的3个宾客\n和1个秘宝所展开的故事。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F4E004E2A56F47ED588AB8BF76765768400334E2A5BBE5BA2000A548C00314E2A79D85B9D62405C555F00768465454E8B300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "被请来的是\n现役训练家<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88AB8BF767657684662F000A73B05F798BAD7EC35BB600100002010200032026202600100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大富豪的旧爱<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>，\n以及宝石收藏家<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005>。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59275BCC8C6A768465E772310010000201020004FF0C000A4EE553CA5B9D77F3653685CF5BB60010000201020005300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大富豪的管家<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>\n负责接待大家。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59275BCC8C6A76847BA15BB600100002018B0001000A8D1F8D2363A55F8559275BB6300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大富豪把宾客都请到了一个房间。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59275BCC8C6A628A5BBE5BA290FD8BF752304E864E004E2A623F95F4300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "管家<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>告诉大家，\n这个房间本身就是一座大金库，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就算使用“愤怒之拳”<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n也无法将其破坏。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 9,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7BA15BB600100002018B0001544A8BC959275BB6FF0C000A8FD94E2A623F95F4672C8EAB5C31662F4E005EA7592791D15E93FF0C00100001BE00000A5C317B974F7F7528201C612460124E4B62F3201D00100001BE00000A4E5F65E06CD55C0651767834574F300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "安置于房间中央的宝石\n叫做“<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0006>之泪”。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 3096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B897F6E4E8E623F95F44E2D592E76845B9D77F3000A53EB505A201C00100002010200064E4B6CEA201D300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "据说，这是被献给过\n曾是国王的AZ的幻之宝石，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n因此大富豪每天早晚都会观赏它来养精蓄锐。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 3152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "636E8BF4FF0C8FD9662F88AB732E7ED98FC7000A66FE662F56FD738B76840041005A76845E7B4E4B5B9D77F3FF0C00100001BE00000A56E06B6459275BCC8C6A6BCF592965E9665A90FD4F1A89C28D4F5B836765517B7CBE84C49510300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "第二天早上……大富豪<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0002>的\n怒吼响彻了整个豪宅。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 3256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C4E8C592965E94E0A2026202659275BCC8C6A00100002010200027684000A6012543C54CD5F7B4E8665744E2A8C6A5B85300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大富豪对聚集在收纳宝石的\n房间前的宾客喊道：<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n“宝石被偷走了！”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 3320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59275BCC8C6A5BF9805A96C6572865367EB35B9D77F37684000A623F95F4524D76845BBE5BA2558A9053FF1A00100001BE00000A201C5B9D77F388AB50778D704E86FF01201D00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "“犯人一定出自管家之外的宾客。”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 3400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "201C72AF4EBA4E005B9A51FA81EA7BA15BB64E4B591676845BBE5BA23002201D00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "被怀疑的<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>问道：\n“为什么要排除管家？”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 3444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88AB600075917684001000020102000495EE9053FF1A000A201C4E3A4EC04E488981639296647BA15BB6FF1F201D00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大富豪回答：“因为管家<U+0010><U+0002>Ƌ<U+0001>\n和我一直玩卡牌到早上，有不在场证明。”<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 3500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59275BCC8C6A56DE7B54FF1A201C56E04E3A7BA15BB600100002018B0001000A548C62114E0076F473A95361724C523065E94E0AFF0C67094E0D5728573A8BC1660E3002201D00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "被怀疑的<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>和<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005>\n表示可以搜身或检查行李。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 3580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "88AB6000759176840010000201020003548C0010000201020005000A8868793A53EF4EE5641C8EAB621668C067E5884C674E300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是管家做了确认。\n但除了训练家<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>的精灵球之外<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n没有任何发现，宝石仍然下落不明……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 3644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8E662F7BA15BB6505A4E86786E8BA43002000A4F4696644E868BAD7EC35BB6001000020102000376847CBE707574034E4B591600100001BE00000A6CA167094EFB4F5553D173B0FF0C5B9D77F34ECD71364E0B843D4E0D660E2026202600100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请回答。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n你知道偷走宝石“<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0006>之泪”的\n犯人是谁吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 3748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF756DE7B54300200100001BE01000A4F6077E5905350778D705B9D77F3201C00100002010200064E4B6CEA201D7684000A72AF4EBA662F8C015417FF1F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0003>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 3820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F00100002010200030000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 3832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F00100002010200040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是<U+0010><U+0002>Ă<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 3844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F00100002010200050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯～嗯～嗯～\n看来这个手法很难被识破啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 3856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF5E55EFFF5E55EFFF5E000A770B67658FD94E2A624B6CD55F8896BE88AB8BC67834554A300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦嚯！\n你果然厉害。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 3908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E656AFFF01000A4F60679C713653895BB3300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在房间内放出宝可梦，\n等大家都离开后让宝可梦偷走宝石。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n被叫回来的时候，\n再神不知鬼不觉地<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n让宝可梦回到精灵球里！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
      "offsetInSection": 3940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5728623F95F45185653E51FA5B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A7B4959275BB690FD79BB5F00540E8BA95B9D53EF68A650778D705B9D77F3300200100001BE01000A88AB53EB56DE6765768465F65019FF0C000A518D795E4E0D77E59B3C4E0D89C9573000100001BE00000A8BA95B9D53EF68A656DE52307CBE7075740391CCFF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如何？\n这是个既大胆又细致的手法吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 67,
      "offsetInSection": 4076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59824F55FF1F000A8FD9662F4E2A65E2592780C653C87EC681F47684624B6CD55427FF1F00100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真是杰作！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 68,
      "offsetInSection": 4124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F67704F5CFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "会被识破的哦",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 69,
      "offsetInSection": 4136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F1A88AB8BC67834768454E60000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这就是所谓意想不到的盲点啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 70,
      "offsetInSection": 4152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD95C31662F62408C13610F60F34E0D5230768476F270B9554A300200100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多亏你不遗余力的协助，\n我才能完成自己的作品！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 71,
      "offsetInSection": 4192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "591A4E8F4F604E0D90574F59529B7684534F52A9FF0C000A6211624D80FD5B8C621081EA5DF176844F5C54C1FF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "作为回报，只要你带宝可梦来给我看，\n我就会把它们替换成这些杰作中的角色，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n然后讲故事给你听！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƵ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 72,
      "offsetInSection": 4248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F5C4E3A56DE62A5FF0C53EA89814F605E265B9D53EF68A667657ED96211770BFF0C000A62115C314F1A628A5B834EEC66FF636262108FD94E9B67704F5C4E2D768489D28272FF0C00100001BE00000A7136540E8BB265454E8B7ED94F60542CFF0100100002011401B50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    }
  ],
